"Login %(login)s does not look like a Gaudi ID. Please contact the IT "
"department.Login %(login)s does not look like a Gaudi ID. Please contact the "
"IT department."

#: cabinet/views.py:238
msgid "Запрос отправлен в учебный отдел. Лист выдадут после оплаты пересдачи."
msgstr ""
"Request sent to the academic office. The sheet is issued after the retake "
"fee is paid."

